      N : int\n1096 |             The number of RGB quantization levels.\n1097 |         gamma : float\n1098 |         \"\"\"\n1099 |         if not np.iterable(colors):\n1100 |             raise ValueError('colors must be iterable')\n1101 | \n1102 |         if (isinstance(colors[0], Sized) and len(colors[0]) == 2\n1103 |                 and not isinstance(colors[0], str)):\n1104 |             # List of value, color pairs\n1105 |             vals, colors = zip(*colors)\n1106 |         else:\n1107 |             vals = np.linspace(0, 1, len(colors))\n1108 | \n1109 |         r, g, b, a = to_rgba_array(colors).T\n1110 |         cdict = {\n1111 |             \"red\": np.column_stack([vals, r, r]),\n1112 |             \"green\": np.column_stack([vals, g, g]),\n1113 |             \"blue\": np.column_stack([vals, b, b]),\n1114 |             \"alpha\": np.column_stack([vals, a, a]),\n1115 |         }\n1116 | \n1117 |         return LinearSegmentedColormap(name, cdict, N, gamma)\n```\n\nFound file `galleries/users_explain/colors/colors.py`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\nHint: Search `galleries/users_explain/colors/colors.py` for the full content if needed.\n\n\n\n##Searching for term \"facecolor\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound function `lib/mpl_toolkits/mplot3d/axes3d.py:Axes3D.voxels`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n3353 | def voxels(self, *args, facecolors=None, edgecolors=None, shade=True,\n3354 |                lightsource=None, axlim_clip=False, **kwargs):\n3355 |         \"\"\"\n3356 |         ax.voxels([x, y, z,] /, filled, facecolors=None, edgecolors=None, \\\n3357 | **kwargs)\n3358 | \n3359 |         Plot a set of filled voxels\n3360 | \n3361 |         All voxels are plotted as 1x1x1 cubes on the axis, with\n3362 |         ``filled[0, 0, 0]`` placed with its lower corner at the origin.\n3363 |         Occluded faces are not plotted.\n3364 | \n3365 |         Parameters\n3366 |         ----------\n3367 |    